35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The treasurer spent six hours a month chasing individual payments.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,That confirms my fear. The administrative burden is unsustainable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,I found that eleven mid-year joiners needed manual calculations.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The door charge killed the weekday vibe. People stopped feeling they belonged.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The data is clear. The same nine people do everything.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, a flat fee seems much easier to manage.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
