46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. It reduces the chasing and the confusion.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,But we must make the entry point less daunting for newcomers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,A flat fee keeps the evenings open without the hesitation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If the fee is fair, the work distribution is a separate issue.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think we are aligned on simplicity.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The numbers support a single, predictable figure.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,We can address the newcomer fear in the communication.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,Let us keep the community feeling intact.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will support the option that minimizes administrative chaos.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
